>speech_prog book~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 2
   say Ah! Yes the Great Book.
   say Have you come to save the city?
   mpmset $n quest 0 5 3
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 3
   say Wonderful!
   ponder
   say There is a problem though...
   say In the last great war the Great Book had pages
   say torn from it.
   say You must find all the pages and the Great Book
   say itself and bring the book to me 
   say Go now and explore the city.
   mpmset $n quest 0 5 4
endif
~
>give_prog i25016~
if quest (0, 5, $n) == 23
   say I will need to start writing some new spells into
   say the book if you intend on defeating the one who
   say destroyed the book in the first place.
   say Please come back later.
   mpjunk i25016
   mpmset $n quest 0 5 24
else
   drop book
   say I think you need it more then I.
endif
