>rand_prog 50~
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 1
   say Long ago when both the drow and elven races
   say were one race and lived in harmony.
   mpmset self quest 0 4 2
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 2
   say There was a young dark elf boy travelling on
   say a quest in the forest nearby his village.
   say As he was walking he noticed a dark ominous
   say glow from a nearby rock formation.
   mpmset self quest 0 4 3
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 3
   say Being intrigued by this, he proceeded to
   say enter the rock formation, being instantly
   say transported to a unknown location deep within
   say the earth.
   mpmset self quest 0 4 4
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 4
   say Once there he noticed two books on an altar
   say facing each other.
   say One book was white and the other black.
   say Both books had been magically sealed eons
   say ago by some great power.
   mpmset self quest 0 6 5
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 5
   say Being curious he took both books with him
   say back to his village to examine them.
   mpmset self quest 0 5 6
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 6
   say Being unable to break the seal on the books,
   say he trained his magical powers to great power.
   say Once he was strong enough he attempted to
   say open the black book.
   mpmset self quest 0 5 7
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 7
   say Instantly he was overwhelmed with an evil
   say spirit which he could not escape from.
   say Once possessed by this evil spirit, he
   say attempted to destroy the white book.
   mpmset self quest 0 4 8
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 8
   say His attempt failed so he tore pages from
   say the book in a vain attempt to prevent his
   say future downfall.
   mpmset self quest 0 4 9
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 9
   say Over centuries, that boy whom had been
   say possessed became a great magical power.
   mpmset self quest 0 4 10
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 10
   say When the factions of the elven race whom
   say had been enraged by the desicration of
   say their homeland became the drow race, and
   say the dark power empowered them all with
   say it's rage.
   mpmset self quest 0 4 11
   break
endif
if quest (0, 4, $i) == 11
   emote ponders his thoughts for a moment.
   say Now that you have listened to my story,
   say what can I do for you?
   mpmset self quest 0 4 0
   mpmset $n quest 0 5 27
   break
endif
