#25223
A Run Down House~
 {060}You stand in what used to be a nice home years and years ago. Neglect 
has made this once beautiful house a slum for it's owner's. Broken chairs 
surround an uneven table. Staircases have holes through the stairs and the 
banister is in pieces and could barely support any weight. Dust hangs on 
the desolate furnishing like a pall, traces of rodent droppings grace the 
corners and the stench of filth greets your nostrils. This truely is a grim 
place to live.
~
