large wooden gates are so thick it seems almost nothing can break through 
them. From what you can see it seems to be a bustling metropolis for all 
who can safetly make it through the tough wilderness. Many travellers come 
from far and wide to trade their merchandise here. Cityguards stand guard 
at this entrance to prevent any evil forces that try and enter the city.
